{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Nobody talks about the fire incident at Estmour mansion. As the new servant, you're bound to keep silence. Things take a strange turn when you find a message from your pyromaniac predecessor... deep inside, there's a truth to uncover.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i><br><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863300/extras/872e3d8555bf24c9b6e4617a43225300.avif?t=1756690583\" width=616 height=150 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 An old fashioned RPG horror game </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Three different endings depending on your choices</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Many investigation puzzles in the mansion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Full Walkthrough available</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Tearoom function to chat with the characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Unlockable bonus room</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863300/extras/2e211e5ae6b6af50d15eee7103f454d8.avif?t=1756690583\" width=616 height=150 /></span><br><br><i>This is a remaster of Deep Inside, originally released in August 2020.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 All the game CGs have been replaced with new artwork</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 New music tracks were added</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Some of the puzzles were changed according to players' feedback</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3863300?t=1756690583","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863300/a4432d8a8fc6e7b1b4d6a9aadaa2fef6a5b94c81/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756690583","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset